The train journey began.
I sat peacefully near the window.
I looked at the other passengers with curiosity.
There was a man in front of me.
He frantically searched for the ticket in his own pockets.
At first, he did not find his own ticket.
There was great worry on his face.
Finally, he found it in his own bag.
Then he became calm.
Afterwards, I looked across the aisle.
There was a little girl there.
Her older brother sat near her.
There was a snack in his hand.
The girl had already eaten her own snack.
So she tried to grab his snack.
The older brother quickly protected his own snack.
He stopped her hand.
They both laughed loudly.
I saw all that.
The start of my journey was very entertaining.
